Can we run an AI agent stack, local RAG, and end-to-end automation at home without a dedicated GPU or Saas subscriptions? **Yes.**

After juggling Saas tiers, tiral runs, and inevitable cancellations, the time had come to take matters into my own hands. Cutting back on third-party dependencies became a priority, and my drive to experiment hands-on naturally led me to acquire my first dedicated server.

By pairing a 35W mini PC (*Lenovo M70q*) with lightweight Q4-quantized models and a hybrid orchestrator, you can deploy a fully sovereign home lab. It handles contract data extraction, GDPR-compliant PII redaction, and 24/7 Youtube radio streaming. All while sustaining a steady 15-20 tok/s throughput.

**The objective**

Build a local, sovereign infrastructure reproductible via IaC and primed for future projects.

